Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Intersection with Multiple Vehicles" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasActor :vehicle2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk2 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle .
:vehicle2 a :Vehicle .

:weather1 a :ClearCondition .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential rear-end collision due to sudden stopping" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Other vehicle encroaching into lane" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.60"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Potential rear-end collision due to sudden stopping
Severity Score: 0.75

Risk 2:
Description: Other vehicle encroaching into lane
Severity Score: 0.60